demonstrated that the combined diagnostic model exhibited good predictive value. Conclusion: The combination of DCE-MRI parameters and radiomics features can be used for the differential diagnosis of EC, demonstrating good predictive efficacy and clinical applicability, providing a reliable imaging diagnostic method for clinical diagnosis of EC.
